Quest 78 "Pet"
    Journal "Pets can be grown."
    Kill 3 of 750, 700, 751, 752 at direction_1
    Kill 3 of 850, 851, 853, 852 at direction_7
    Kill 3 of 150 at direction_11
    Kill 3 of 250 at direction_34

