    Give 1 of 600001000
    Give 5 of 389191000

direction_1 = location "Worm" about "Worm\nA giant worm-like monster which levels head-on attacks with long tentacles and body" found "Inhabits the bridgefront outside Moradon central gate" at 637 429 in zone 21
direction_11 = location "Kecoon" about "Kecoon\nBipedal insect evolved from the war against Pathos" found "Moradon lakefront" at 616 341 in zone 21
direction_34 = location "Bulcan" about "Bulcan\nRepresentative monster of Moradon which refines traces of steel from the earth in its stomach" found "Moradon seashore" at 535 414 in zone 21
direction_7 = location "Bandicoot" about "Bandicoot\nA rodent which grew abnormally by feeding on corpses of evil races in the War with Pathos." found "Inhabits Seashore of Hope" at 632 465 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Aren't you tired of travelling alone, master? Why not get yourself one of the Familiars that [Trainer] Kate breeds?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Familiars, devoid of evil, are surfacing all over the continent. Are you ready to domesticate them?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Before you receive a Familiar egg, show me you're ready to tame this docile creature \n If you've undertaken [Sentinel] Patrick's task diligently, it should not be difficult."

On ready
    Say "Master, you've completed the task \n Go to [Trainer] Kate and receive the Familiar egg."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You've completed the task. \nAfter the egg hatches, use summon items to summon the Familiar. Place the summon items in the shortcut-key window. They can be bought from the sundries store."
